#######################
### get avatar
GET localhost:9080/lab2/api/user/avatar/05fa71de-9473-4c8d-b341-9f2aa38e1008

### PUT/POST avatar
POST localhost:9080/lab2/api/user/avatar/05fa71de-9473-4c8d-b341-9f2aa38e1008
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="avatar"; filename="maklowicz.png"

< src/main/resources/avatars/maklowicz.png
--boundary--

### delete avatar
DELETE localhost:9080/lab2/api/user/avatar/05fa71de-9473-4c8d-b341-9f2aa38e1008



